EN:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}What do you think? {{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}I tried to look
nice wearing some {{TAG:0005:0023:00CD}}
clothes today{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}When the fashion trend goes around{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
and comes back to the start,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} the
style will become popular again.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Even if I don't know what's hip at
the moment,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} eventually{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}fashion will
start to catch up with me!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¿Qué tal me queda? {{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}Hay días en que
me pirra vestir {{TAG:0005:0023:00CD}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡y hoy es uno de ellos!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}La moda es algo cíclico,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
así que este estilo se volverá{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} 
a llevar tarde o temprano.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Lo que no sé{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} es cuándo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}se volverá
a llevar la ropa de la prehistoria.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Espero que nunca!

